==English==

===Etymology===
Compare Danish {{term|skvætte}} (rare)/{{term|skvatte||to splash}} (nominalised: {{term|skvæt}}), Icelandic {{term|skvetta||to squirt}}, Norwegian bokmål {{term|skvette}}.<ref>{{R:Webster 1913|squander}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈskwɒndəɹ/}}

